Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "message": "How many active clients do we have?"
}

### Chat - Ask about revenue
POST {{baseUrl}}/chat
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "message": "Show me the revenue stats for this month"
}

### Chat - Ask about attendance
