### Chat - With conversation ID (for context)
POST {{baseUrl}}/chat
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "message": "Tell me more details",
  "conversation_id": "your-conversation-id-here"
}

### Delete Conversation
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/chat/your-conversation-id-here
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
